(text "EM9190 / EM9191: fit all three links.\nEM929x: fit all three for eight-contact current sharing.\nRM520N-GLAA: all three MUST be absent.\nP24 is Quectel 1.8 V output; P38 is an input; P68 reserved." (at 220.98 175.26 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2dd7aeb9-c5bd-5bf3-9862-7352ab6162ef"))
