(text "Independent modem rail / safe unconfigured state" (at 13.97 222.25 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left top)) (uuid "aa22b649-7c48-5187-a0a3-579f7a0b709c"))
(text "VCC_MODEM comes from the independent switched rail; converter, bulk and sequencing are being integrated.\nAll assembly-profile links default DNP. Configure only with all sources removed and VCC_MODEM discharged.\n3.135-4.4 V operating range; design target 3.7 V. This sheet does not establish the final power budget." (at 17.78 231.14 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "17bbef26-bdde-50d9-b113-dc71b442e168"))
